; CadCoreFramework — AutoCAD integration smoke test script
;
; Driven by run-integration-tests.ps1 under accoreconsole.exe.
; accoreconsole runs AutoCAD in a headless mode: no GUI, no palettes, just the
; command line + database. The /i and /s flags feed this .scr file into it line
; by line. Palette/UI commands (SHOW_PALETTE etc.) are intentionally skipped.
;
; A line beginning with ';' is a comment. Blank lines send ENTER.
; Each real command must be terminated by either a space or a newline.
;
; EXIT CODE: accoreconsole returns 0 if every command dispatched. Semantic
; failures (CORE_TEST_ALL throwing silently) still return 0 — the runner script
; must parse the console log for "[ERROR]" / "Fatal" / "eLockViolation" markers.

; ─── 1. Load the plugin ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; NETLOAD takes an absolute path to the DLL — provided via COMMAND_LINE_ARG by
; the runner script, which substitutes {{DLL_PATH}} before invocation.
NETLOAD
"{{DLL_PATH}}"

; ─── 2. Smoke tests ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; CORE_INFO: verifies DI container resolved and plugin reported ready.
CORE_INFO

; CORE_TEST_ALL: full exercise — Layer creation, Rectangle/MText/DBText draw,
; XData round-trip. Exercises CadContext.Execute, UpgradeOpen (ForRead → ForWrite),
; EnsureLayer, DrawRectangle, DrawMText, DrawText, SetMetadata/GetMetadata.
CORE_TEST_ALL

; DRAW_CIRCLE_SAMPLE: minimal single-draw path. Exercises DrawCircle.
DRAW_CIRCLE_SAMPLE

; ─── 3. Exit ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
QUIT
Y
